---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16">
    <header class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="mb-6 font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-white">
        ShellTrivia
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral">
        GUI-based trivia game with multiple levels, categories, and interactive scoring system.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Game Overview</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral">Developed a GUI-based trivia game with four levels, testing players on music, film, sports, current affairs, and general knowledge. The game awarded or deducted "shells" (points) based on correct or incorrect answers.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Game Features</h2>
        <ul class="text-neutral list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>Four progressive difficulty levels</li>
          <li>Multiple categories: Music, Film, Sports, Current Affairs, General Knowledge</li>
          <li>Shell-based scoring system (points awarded/deducted)</li>
          <li>Interactive leaderboard tracking high scores</li>
          <li>Category selection and personalized gameplay</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Technologies Used</h2>
        <ul class="text-neutral list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>Tkinter (Python GUI framework)</li>
          <li>Python Data Structures for question management</li>
          <li>File I/O for persistence and score tracking</li>
          <li>Object-Oriented Programming principles</li>
          <li>Event-driven programming for user interactions</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <a href="https://drive.com" target="_blank" class="rounded-full bg-primary px-8 py-4 text-white font-medium hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors after:ml-2 after:content-[url(/external.svg)]">
          View Demo Video
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>